  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unicef PCA 2023-25 Thematic Fund for Nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buidling on collaboration with UNICEF through the project &quot;Better Diets for Better Growth (2018-2022), Norway is from 2023 initiating support to UNICEFs thematic fund for nutrition. The support is heavily earmarked to the focus countries in the Norwegian food security strategy, Ghana, Tanzania, Malawi, Uganda and Kenya, and to two of UNICEFs working areas in nutrition; early childhood prevention and adolescence, reaching especially girls and young women. Children with disabilities will also be targeted.</narrative>
  </description>
